<h1 id="one" data-node="2" class="opening">One</h1>
<p id="n4" data-node="4">He arrived <em>on a Tuesday</em>, <strong>late</strong>, with <code>a trunk</code>, a <s>cat</s> and <a href="section-002.xhtml#n75">a letter</a> in a <span class="hand">plain hand</span>.<a epub:type="noteref" role="doc-noteref" href="#note-1">1</a> The porter said nothing.<br/>Nobody asked him to.</p>
